# Used by tests/golden.py (opz_mix.h): level 255 and pan 127 at the note-on, then level 128 at step 2, pan 0 (hard
# left) at step 4, pan 255 (hard right) at step 14 and level 0 at step 24; the host smooths each move by 1/64 per
# block, so each gets ten steps (~860 blocks) to reach a gain of exactly 0.
tempo 120
steps 36
tail 0.1
track lead
preset 0 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 0 127 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
param level 128 2
param pan 0 4
param pan 255 14
param level 0 24
note 0 C4 36 100
